cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or scripts, please cite the article below and this repository."
type: dataset
title: "Reinforcement Learning and Bandit-based Defenses for Robust Federated Learning: Systematic Literature Review Data"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary material for a systematic literature review of reinforcement
  learning and bandit-based defenses for robust federated learning: protocol and
  amendments, search records, screening decisions, extraction and quality forms,
  inter-rater reliability checks, and scripts that recompute the counts reported
  in the article.
